# inc-qylz: reach the level-up feat menu of the frozen lizardfolk monk.
# Run by tools/check_seneschal_implemented.sh with
# INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/lizardfolk-monk-seed1.sav.
#
# Free Advancement (wizard mode switches, third row) lets G on the character
# sheet gain a level with no experience points. The level-up menus are fixed by
# the fixture, so no roll decides this path. @expect makes a missed menu fail
# the run (exit 6) instead of dumping the wrong screen.
s
w y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*2
SPACE
@expect "Free Advancement                           YES"
ESC
@until "Things in View" ESC
d
@expect "Gender"
G
@while "Choose Spells" ENTER
@while "You feel" ESC
G
@expect "Choose a feat; the following are available"
